WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Divergent • crust is created
Magma fills the opening, freezes into basalt, and travels away with both plates.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Convergent • lithosphere is consumed
Oceanic lithosphere bends into the mantle as the plates converge.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Transform • crust is conserved
The river moves with each block. Sliding offsets it without making or destroying crust.
